# Supply chain

- Lock: API `uv.lock` (`uv sync --frozen`); panel `pnpm-lock.yaml` — commit et; npm/yarn lock ekleme
- Audit: `pip-audit` (uv export) · `pnpm audit --prod`; kritik CVE → güncelle/override
- EOL/unmaintained yok; seed/dev runtime’a koyma (`[dependency-groups]`); bilinmeyen paketi incele
- Patch/minor: `uv lock --upgrade` / `pnpm update`; pnpm `overrides` dikkatli
